#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:29
msgid ""
"The B<iswalnum>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<isalnum>(3)  function.  It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"alnum\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:32
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is a subclass of the wide-character class "
"\"graph\", and therefore also a subclass of the wide-character class "
"\"print\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:36
msgid ""
"Being a subclass of the wide-character class \"print\", the wide-character "
"class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class \"cntrl\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:40
msgid ""
"Being a subclass of the wide-character class \"graph\", the wide-character "
"class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class \"space\" and its "
"subclass \"blank\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:43
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class "
"\"punct\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:48
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is the union of the wide-character "
"classes \"alpha\" and \"digit\".  As such, it also contains the "
"wide-character class \"xdigit\"."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:54
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" always contains at least the letters "
"\\[aq]A\\[aq] to \\[aq]Z\\[aq], \\[aq]a\\[aq] to \\[aq]z\\[aq], and the "
"digits \\[aq]0\\[aq] to \\[aq]9\\[aq]."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:54 build/C/man3/iswalpha.3:55
#: build/C/man3/iswblank.3:52 build/C/man3/iswcntrl.3:40
#: build/C/man3/iswctype.3:42 build/C/man3/iswdigit.3:54
#: build/C/man3/iswgraph.3:47 build/C/man3/iswlower.3:61
#: build/C/man3/iswprint.3:34 build/C/man3/iswpunct.3:45
#: build/C/man3/iswspace.3:43 build/C/man3/iswupper.3:56
#: build/C/man3/iswxdigit.3:47 build/C/man3/towctrans.3:39
#: build/C/man3/towlower.3:72 build/C/man3/towupper.3:71
#: build/C/man3/wctrans.3:50 build/C/man3/wctype.3:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/iswalnum.3:63
msgid ""
"The B<iswalnum>()  function returns nonzero if I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"alnum\".  Otherwise, it returns "
"zero."
msgstr ""

